@host = https://localhost:7167

### Monthly expenses of a year (omit ?year for the current year)
GET {{host}}/api/expenses/monthly?year=2026

### Costs per category of a year
GET {{host}}/api/expenses/categories?year=2026

### Add an entry -> 201 Created; the response contains the new id
POST {{host}}/api/expenses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-10-15",
  "category": "Essen",
  "expense": 12.5,
  "note": "Pizza"
}

### Read one entry (replace 631 with the id from the POST response)
GET {{host}}/api/expenses/631

### Edit that entry -> 204 No Content
PUT {{host}}/api/expenses/631
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-10-15",
  "category": "Essen",
  "expense": 14.9,
  "note": "Pizza + Cola"
}

### ---- Error cases ----

### 400: year out of range
GET {{host}}/api/expenses/monthly?year=0

### 400: category missing, expense negative, date missing
POST {{host}}/api/expenses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "",
  "expense": -5
}

### 404: unknown id
PUT {{host}}/api/expenses/99999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-10-15",
  "category": "Essen",
  "expense": 1
}
